Oh lord yes, raspberry and dark! Plus dark always in ice cream, imo. Way too much milk in there already. It’s all about contrast. 

One year on Valentine’s Day, I set my mind to deciding which berries were the best. Someone had to do it. After eating several pounds of chocolate dipped strawberries during the week, to me, the milk chocolate was the best. Frankly I was surprised. Milk chocolate brings an almost savory flavor (I’m thinking it’s a bit of umami) that adds a layer of complexity to a good strawberry. Dark chocolate was good, don’t get me wrong, but in my book, milk tastes better. Let’s not discuss white chocolate, ok? I put that in the category of to each his own.

