@Suzy @Nancy
Oh boy, oh boy! I get to use a piece of obscure knowledge that (I think?) I learned in a previous Wordplay column! HIPAA and LASER and SCUBA are acronyms, not initialisms. The difference being that an acronym is pronounced as a word, while an initialism is pronounced by saying each letter. So FBI is an initialism, whereas OSHA is an acronym. Thank you for coming to my TED* talk!

* acronym

